                "description": "The Octagon Knob with Rectangular Rose will fit most pre-drilled doors. It is available with an optional backset of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches and will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors. Choose from several beautiful, modern finish color options. The Modern Brass Octagon Knobset with Rectangular Rosette is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. Its unique shape is a true accent to your contemporary home.",
